<title>UK: DAIWA HIRES HEAD OF EUROMARKET TRADING IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>DAIWA HIRES HEAD OF EUROMARKET TRADING IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Europe Ltd said on Thursday it appointed Phil Brewer as head of Euromarket trading in New York as part of the company's expansion of its Global Bond Unit.</p>
<p>Daiwa said in a statement that Brewer will join from Deutsche Morgan Grenfell in New York, where he held a similar position.</p>
<p>Kate Hollis, also of DMG, will join as a senior salesperson in the UK/Hedge Fund group in London, and Peter Sudworth will join in the same capacity from Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit + 44 171 542 6137</p>
</text>
